1
00:00:00,243 --> 00:00:02,473
(Raj:)Well, maybe there's a way
to appear nonaggressive,

2
00:00:02,479 --> 00:00:04,949
(Raj:)but also be able to protect
ourselves if necessary.

3
00:00:04,948 --> 00:00:07,518
(Raj:)Like smiling and waving
with one hand,

4
00:00:07,517 --> 00:00:10,817
(Raj:)but the other hand holding
the severed head of a tiger.

5
00:00:10,821 --> 00:00:12,791
(Howard:)You want to send
a passive-aggressive message

6
00:00:12,789 --> 00:00:13,959
(Howard:)out into the universe?

7
00:00:13,957 --> 00:00:15,157
(Howard:)That's ridiculous.

8
00:00:15,158 --> 00:00:16,788
(Raj:)Oh, you mean passive-aggressive

9
00:00:16,793 --> 00:00:18,763
(Raj:)like posting pictures
of you and your wife

10
00:00:18,762 --> 00:00:20,092
(Raj:)eating cosmopolitan balls

11
00:00:20,097 --> 00:00:22,767
(Raj:)that you know belong
in my mouth?

12
00:00:24,867 --> 00:00:26,797
(Sheldon:)Perhaps Howard meant
passive-aggressive

13
00:00:26,803 --> 00:00:29,473
(Sheldon:)like asking our group
to help on your project,

14
00:00:29,473 --> 00:00:31,173
(Sheldon:)and then only
choosing Leonard.

15
00:00:31,174 --> 00:00:34,014
(sighs) Look, I'm sorry
I hurt your feelings,

16
00:00:34,011 --> 00:00:36,481
(Raj:)but you do have
strong personalities

17
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:38,380
(Raj:)and always end up taking over.

18
00:00:38,382 --> 00:00:39,752
(Howard:)It's not always.

19
00:00:39,750 --> 00:00:41,480
(Leonard:)What about when we went
to Comic-Con

20
00:00:41,485 --> 00:00:43,015
(Leonard:)and dressed like Jabba the Hutt?

21
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:45,520
(Leonard:)You got to be Jabba's head,
and I got to be

22
00:00:45,522 --> 00:00:47,592
(Leonard:)his fat slug butt.

23
00:00:48,991 --> 00:00:51,931
(Sheldon:)We looked great.

24
00:00:51,929 --> 00:00:54,059
(Leonard:)You let a guy sit on me.

25
00:00:54,064 --> 00:00:55,734
(Howard:)He was dressed as Princess Leia.

26
00:00:55,732 --> 00:00:59,022
(Howard:)It made a nice picture.

